[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7861.589, "timestamp": "02:11:01", "text": "意思是说，我昨天睡得很晚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7865.189, "timestamp": "02:11:05", "text": "我大概凌晨3点或4点40分醒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7867.83, "timestamp": "02:11:07", "text": "下午或者别的什么。我度过了一段美好的时光"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7869.83, "timestamp": "02:11:09", "text": "睡觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7871.589, "timestamp": "02:11:11", "text": "那挺好的。那也挺好的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7873.75, "timestamp": "02:11:13", "text": "虽然有点不健康，但味道不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7876.149, "timestamp": "02:11:16", "text": "很好。不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7879.03, "timestamp": "02:11:19", "text": "我们需要尽可能多地睡觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7882.95, "timestamp": "02:11:22", "text": "是的。嗯。事情的起因是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7886.31, "timestamp": "02:11:26", "text": "当时我在直播，因为我……喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7889.109, "timestamp": "02:11:29", "text": "我之所以问你关于丹的事，是因为我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7892.31, "timestamp": "02:11:32", "text": "之所以制定这个计划，是因为他们有这个东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7894.229, "timestamp": "02:11:34", "text": "嗯，我真的很喜欢这个视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7896.79, "timestamp": "02:11:36", "text": "他们还做了些测试，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7901.51, "timestamp": "02:11:41", "text": "正确的？所以我想，为什么不这样做呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7903.91, "timestamp": "02:11:43", "text": "是的，我也可以转换。总之，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7906.149, "timestamp": "02:11:46", "text": "我们看看能不能弄到一些东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7910.149, "timestamp": "02:11:50", "text": "它的。正确的。所以第一件事是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7913.03, "timestamp": "02:11:53", "text": "测验名称是：你是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7917.669, "timestamp": "02:11:57", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7919.43, "timestamp": "02:11:59", "text": "对，我喜欢这种幽默。"}]